## nwk1 `company`

PK `id`. Used columns: `franchisee_name`, address/phone/email fields, `sr_id`, `ac_id`, `product_array`, `rd_available`, `company_active`, `company_hotel_active`, `poll_username`, `poll_password`, `access_hash`, `fcode`, notes/shipping/Coke fields (`updater.php`, `ajax.php`, `api/index.php`).

## nwk1 `locations`

Natural key `location_number`. `real_location_number` for POS vs mail ID. `loc_comp_id` → `company.id`. Pulse: `vpn_ip_address`, `vpn_custom_user`, `vpn_custom_password`. NLL flags: `location_new`, `location_late`, `location_lapsed`. Freq window: `location_freq_start`/`location_freq_stop`. Geo: `location_lat`/`lng`.

NLL settings live in `nll_settings` (joined in `nllProvider.inc:14` by `store_number`).

