## `MassMail_RAW`

Port `001:111-141`. INSERT IGNORE `insertFiles.inc:76`. Skip empty Street (`:82`). Dates via `strtotime` of Pulse tab fields (`:83-86`) — **ET wall-clock epochs**, not UTC (`bbi-sst/docs/how-it-works.md`).

Key columns: `store_number`, `phone`, `CustomerName`, `Street/City/State/Zip`, `FirstOrderDate`, `LastOrderDate`, `LastLateOrderDate`, `LastDeliveryTime`, `CustomerProfileID`, offer/lifetime fields, `Version`.

Index `MassMail_RAW_extract` `(store_number, LastOrderDate, FirstOrderDate, LastLateOrderDate)` (`001:142`). SST UK `(store_number, CustomerProfileID, LastOrderDate, filename)` + required `filename`.

## `OR2_Raw`

Port `001:188+`. PK `(Location_Code, Order_Number, Actual_Order_Date)`. INSERT IGNORE `insertFiles.inc:14`. Keep `Order_Status_Code == 4` only (`:20`).

## Campaign tables (legacy materialization)

Written **after** AccuZIP parse, not at ingest.

**`NewCustomers`** (`001:161`, `parseFiles.inc:75`): `store_number`, postal + `old_*`, `last_order`, `customer_code`, later `mailed`, `late_matched`, ROI fields.

**`LateCustomers`**: same shape; `new_matched` (`parseFiles.inc:200`).

**`LapsedCustomers`**: insert in `generate_nll.php:733` (`lapsed_counter`, `mailed_date`, `mailed_state`).

SST NLL **does not** write these as the ingest path; procedures join RAW ⨝ `mailing_addresses` (`05-modernization-mapping.mdc`).

