## SST `mailing_addresses`

`migrations/20260709120200_003_nll_domain_tables.ts:19-49` + `is_invalid` (migration 012).

| Column | Role |
|---|---|
| `old_address/city/state/zip` | MMC identity (`MassMail_RAW.Street/City/State/Zip`) |
| `pulse_profile_id` | `CustomerProfileID` text |
| `address, city, state, zip5, zip4, crrt` | post-AccuZIP |
| `is_valid` | 1 after successful apply |
| `is_invalid` | AccuZIP hard-fail; never downgrade a valid row |

UK `(store_number, pulse_profile_id, old_address, old_city, old_state, old_zip)`. Ingest insert-ignore; AccuZIP apply owns updates.

---

## Seed path

1. nwk1 `company` + `locations` → POST `pollingInfoRequest`
2. apollo `daily_polling` → NTLM download → `file_list` + `OrderData/` + `MailData/`
3. `insertFiles` → `OR2_Raw` / `MassMail_RAW`
4. AccuZIP → `NewCustomers` / `LateCustomers` / MassMail parse → `scan_lapsed` → NLL → `LapsedCustomers`
